  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Organizing IBM Certification Workshop on “Principals of Visual Design”</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\nWomen Cell, ATME College of Engineering in association with Aspire for Her (AFH) Organizing IBM Certification Workshop on\n\n“Principals of Visual Design”\n\n<strong>Resource Person:</strong>\nShruti Shrivastava\nVisual Designer and Design Thinker, IBM\n\nSoumya Prasada\nSenior Technical Manager, IBM\n\nObjectives of the Webinar:\n<ul>\n \t<li>Learn with IBM</li>\n \t<li>Bringing the best quality technical upskilling to the college</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Date: 28 th August 2021</strong>\n\n<strong>Time: 4PM</strong>\n\n<strong>Target participants: Students of ATMECE</strong>\n\n<strong>Meeting Platform: Zoom</strong>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
